248, 443–445 (1980).</cite> [<a href="https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?journal=Nature&amp;title=Stromatolites%203,400%E2%80%933,500%20Myr%20old%20from%20the%20North%20Pole%20area,%20Western%20Australia&amp;author=M.%20R.%20Walter&amp;author=R.%20Buick&amp;author=J.%20S.%20R.%20Dunlop&amp;volume=248&amp;publication_year=1980&amp;pages=443-445&amp;" class="usa-link usa-link--external" data-ga-action="click_feat_suppl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Scholar</a>]</li>
